    "sources": {
      "IK-33810117:L61:span1": {
        "text": "the premises described as third floor of property bearing No.4-E/7, Jhandewalan Extension, New Delhi (subject premises), let out initially by a lease deed (Ex.PW-1/R1) dated 27. 06.1979 in the name of a partnership firm described as M/s. Current Advertising and Marketing in which M.L. Aggarwal and R.P. Aggarwal were partners.",
        "document_id": "33810117",
        "url": "https://indiankanoon.org/doc/33810117/",
        "semantic_stage": "PRE_TARGET_RECORD",
        "prospective_availability": "RETROSPECTIVELY_RECONSTRUCTED_PRE_TARGET"
      },
      "IK-33810117:L62:span2": {
        "text": "It is further an admitted fact that the said partnership firm was converted into a private limited company in the name and style of M/s. Current Advertising (P) Limited (the first respondent)",
        "document_id": "33810117",
        "url": "https://indiankanoon.org/doc/33810117/",
        "semantic_stage": "PRE_TARGET_RECORD",
        "prospective_availability": "RETROSPECTIVELY_RECONSTRUCTED_PRE_TARGET"
      },
      "IK-33810117:L63:span3": {
        "text": "It is further undisputed that the tenancy rights were transferred in the name of the first respondent, it having been accepted as the tenancy qua the subject premises with effect from 27.03.1990.",
        "document_id": "33810117",
        "url": "https://indiankanoon.org/doc/33810117/",
        "semantic_stage": "PRE_TARGET_RECORD",
        "prospective_availability": "RETROSPECTIVELY_RECONSTRUCTED_PRE_TARGET"
      },
      "IK-33810117:L63:span4": {
        "text": "It is admitted that the said Directors of the first respondent company parted ways w.e.f April, 1992 where after one of them, viz., M.L. Aggarwal took over the said company, having shifted elsewhere, the other Director (R.P. Aggarwal) continuing on the subject premises retaining its control.",
        "document_id": "33810117",
        "url": "https://indiankanoon.org/doc/33810117/",
        "semantic_stage": "PRE_TARGET_RECORD",
        "prospective_availability": "RETROSPECTIVELY_RECONSTRUCTED_PRE_TARGET"
      },
      "IK-33810117:L64:span5": {
        "text": "The subject premises concededly came to be in use and occupation of M/s. Censor Advertising Pvt. Ltd., (second respondent), a company in which R.P. Aggarwal is a Director.",
        "document_id": "33810117",
        "url": "https://indiankanoon.org/doc/33810117/",
        "semantic_stage": "PRE_TARGET_RECORD",
        "prospective_availability": "RETROSPECTIVELY_RECONSTRUCTED_PRE_TARGET"
